{"strongs": "H2450", "word": "חָכָם", "translit": "cha.kham", "root": "חכם", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "wise", "definition": "חָכָם adjective wise , ׳ ח Deut 4:6 + 67 t.; construct חֲכַם Isa 3:3 + 9 t.; plural חֲכָמִים Deut 1:13 + 39 t.; construct חַכְמֵי Exod 28:3 + 4 t.; suffix חֲכָמֶיךָ Isa 19:12 etc. + 8 t.; feminine חֲכָמָה 2Sam 14:2 ; 2Sam 20:16 construct חַכְמַת Exod 35:25 plural חֲכָמוֺת Jer 9:16 construct חַכְמוֺת Judg 5:29 ; Prov 14:1 (but read חָכְמוֺת De ) — 1. skilful in technical work; artificers Isa 3:3 sailors Ezek 27:8 , so (probably) v Ezek 27:9 mourning women Jer 9:16 artisans of tabernacle and temple and their furniture Exod 28:3 ; Exod 31:6 ; Exod 35:10 ; Exod 36:1 ; Exod 36:2 ; Exod 36:4 ; Exod 36:8 ( P ), 1Chr 22:15 ; 2Chr 2:6 ; 2Chr 2:12 ; 2Chr 2:13 (twice in verse); women in spinning Exod 35:25 ( P ); goldsmiths and other artisans Jer 10:9 makers of idol-images Isa 40:20 . 2. wise in the administration of affairs: Joseph in Egypt Gen 41:33 ; Gen 41:39 ( E ); heads of tribes Deut 1:13 ; Deut 1:15 ; Judg 16:19 David 2Sam 14:20 , of Solomon 1Kgs 2:9 ; 1Kgs 3:12 ; 1Kgs 5:21 = 2Chr 2:11 the prince of Tyre, in satire Ezek 28:3 of kings in general Prov 20:26 class of political advisers of Judah Isa 29:14 ; Jer 18:18 , apparently also Isa 5:21 of Egypt Isa 19:11 (twice in verse); Isa 19:12 , Edom Obad 1:8 , the nations Jer 10:7 so of God Isa 31:2 . 3. shrewd, crafty, cunning: Jonadab 2Sam 13:3 the princesses Judg 5:29 אשׁה חכמה wise woman 2Sam 14:2 ; 2Sam 20:16 generally, Jer 9:22 intelligent animals Prov 30:24 בערמם ׳ לכד ח taking the cunning in their craft Job 5:13 חכם בעיני wise in one's own eyes Prov 3:7 ; Prov 26:5 ; Prov 26:12 ; Prov 26:16 ; Prov 28:11 חכמי לב wise of mind (in their own mind) Job 37:24 . 4. plural class of learned and shrewd men, including astrologers, magicians and the like, of Egypt Gen 41:8 ( E ), Exod 7:11 ( P ; compare Isa 19:11 (twice in verse); Isa 19:12 ); Babylon Isa 44:25 ; Jer 50:35 ; Jer 51:57 Persia Esth 1:13 ; Esth 6:13 . 5. prudent , towards king Prov 16:14 in controversies Prov 11:29 ; Prov 29:8 ; Prov 29:9 ; Prov 29:11 religious affairs Hos 13:13 ; Hos 14:10 ; Jer 4:22 ; Jer 8:8 ; Jer 8:9 ; Deut 4:6 ; Deut 32:6 ; Ps 107:43 אישׁ ׳ ח Jer 9:11 . 6. wise , ethically and religiously,. in Wisdom Literature: \\ \\ a. as adjective, חֲכַם לֵב wise of mind Prov 10:8 ; Prov 16:21 לֵב חָכָם Eccl 8:5 of the son Prov 10:1 = Prov 15:20 ; Prov 13:1 ; Prov 23:24 ; Eccl 2:19 ׳ ילד ח Eccl 4:13 wise boy ; ׳ גבר ח Job 34:34 wise man ; ׳ מוכיח ח wise reprover Prov 25:12 . \\ \\ b. = substantive: (1) as a wise learner in school of wisdom, he fears God and departs from evil Prov 14:16 is silent Prov 17:28 hearkens to counsel Prov 12:15 hears and increases in learning Prov 1:5 his ear seeketh knowledge Prov 18:15 he receives it Prov 21:11 and stores it up Prov 10:14 his ears hearken to the reproof which giveth life Prov 15:31 and he becomes wiser through it Prov 9:8 ; Prov 9:9 . (2) as a wise teacher, a sage , he does not answer with windy knowledge Job 15:2 he tells the experience of the past Job 15:48 has knowledge Job 34:2 teaches it Eccl 12:9 disperses it Prov 15:7 his tongue is health Prov 12:18 it utters knowledge aright Prov 15:2 his mind instructs his mouth and adds learning to his lips Prov 16:23 his words are gracious Eccl 10:12 it is good to hear his rebuke Eccl 7:5 his instruction is a fountain of life Prov 13:14 one walking with him becomes wiser Prov 13:20 . The חכמים recall the Greek σόφοι , having their schools, pupils ( בֵן ), discipline ( מוּסָר ), principles and collections of wisdom, דברי חכמים Prov 1:6 ; Prov 22:17 (compare Prov 24:23 ), Eccl 9:17 ; Eccl 12:11 God himself is חכם לבב Job 9:4 . (3) the wise are prosperous: true, in sceptical view of Ecclesiastes, they have no advantage over the fool Eccl 6:8 but die as the fool Eccl 2:16 (twice in verse); Ps 49:11 they will not be able to find the works of God Eccl 8:17 like others are in the hands of God Eccl 9:1 they do not secure bread Eccl 9:11 but elsewhere reverse is true: precious treasure is in his dwelling Prov 21:20 his lips preserve him Prov 14:3 they inherit glory Prov 3:35 wealth is their crown Prov 14:24 the wise man is strong Prov 24:5 ; Eccl 7:19 his eyes are in his head Eccl 2:14 his mind is at his right hand Eccl 10:2 he interprets things Eccl 8:1 (4) the wise man is a blessing to others: he wins men Prov 11:30 scales the city of the mighty Prov 21:22 though poor he delivers the city Eccl 9:15 is a reproof to scorners Prov 15:12 his mind is in the house of mourning Eccl 7:4 injustice makes him foolish Eccl 7:7 Job finds no wise men among his cruel friends Job 17:10 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2735')\">BDB2735</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2450')\">H2450</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2734')\">BDB2734</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2736')\">BDB2736</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָכָם</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>wise</highlightword>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,6)\">Deut 4:6</ref> + 67 t.; construct <bdbheb>חֲכַם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 3:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,3)\">Isa 3:3</ref> + 9 t.; plural <bdbheb>חֲכָמִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 1:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,13)\">Deut 1:13</ref> + 39 t.; construct <bdbheb>חַכְמֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 28:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,3)\">Exod 28:3</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>חֲכָמֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 19:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,12)\">Isa 19:12</ref> etc. + 8 t.; <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>חֲכָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,2)\">2Sam 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,16)\">2Sam 20:16</ref> construct <bdbheb>חַכְמַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,25)\">Exod 35:25</ref> plural <bdbheb>חֲכָמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 9:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,16)\">Jer 9:16</ref> construct <bdbheb>חַכְמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:29\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,29)\">Judg 5:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,1)\">Prov 14:1</ref>(but read <bdbheb>חָכְמוֺת</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>skilful</highlight> in technical work; artificers <ref ref=\"Isa 3:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,3)\">Isa 3:3</ref> sailors <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,8)\">Ezek 27:8</ref>, so (probably) v<ref ref=\"Ezek 27:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,9)\">Ezek 27:9</ref> mourning women <ref ref=\"Jer 9:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,16)\">Jer 9:16</ref> artisans of tabernacle and temple and their furniture <ref ref=\"Exod 28:3\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(2,28,3)\">Exod 28:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,6)\">Exod 31:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,10)\">Exod 35:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,1)\">Exod 36:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,2)\">Exod 36:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,4)\">Exod 36:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 36:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,8)\">Exod 36:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Chr 22:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,22,15)\">1Chr 22:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,6)\">2Chr 2:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,12)\">2Chr 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,13)\">2Chr 2:13</ref> (twice in verse); women in spinning <ref ref=\"Exod 35:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,25)\">Exod 35:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); goldsmiths and other artisans <ref ref=\"Jer 10:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,9)\">Jer 10:9</ref> makers of idol-images <ref ref=\"Isa 40:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,40,20)\">Isa 40:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>wise in the administration of affairs:</highlight> Joseph in Egypt <ref ref=\"Gen 41:33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,33)\">Gen 41:33</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:39\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,39)\">Gen 41:39</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); heads of tribes <ref ref=\"Deut 1:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,13)\">Deut 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 1:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,1,15)\">Deut 1:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 16:19\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,19)\">Judg 16:19</ref> David <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:20\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,20)\">2Sam 14:20</ref>, of Solomon <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,9)\">1Kgs 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:12\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,12)\">1Kgs 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 5:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,5,21)\">1Kgs 5:21</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:11\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,11)\">2Chr 2:11</ref> the prince of Tyre, in satire <ref ref=\"Ezek 28:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,28,3)\">Ezek 28:3</ref> of kings in general <ref ref=\"Prov 20:26\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,26)\">Prov 20:26</ref> class of political advisers of Judah <ref ref=\"Isa 29:14\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(23,29,14)\">Isa 29:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 18:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,18,18)\">Jer 18:18</ref>, apparently also <ref ref=\"Isa 5:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,21)\">Isa 5:21</ref> of Egypt <ref ref=\"Isa 19:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,11)\">Isa 19:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 19:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,12)\">Isa 19:12</ref>, Edom <ref ref=\"Obad 1:8\" b=\"31\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(31,1,8)\">Obad 1:8</ref>, the nations <ref ref=\"Jer 10:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,7)\">Jer 10:7</ref> so of God <ref ref=\"Isa 31:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,31,2)\">Isa 31:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>shrewd, crafty, cunning:</highlight> Jonadab <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,3)\">2Sam 13:3</ref> the princesses <ref ref=\"Judg 5:29\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,29)\">Judg 5:29</ref> <bdbheb>אשׁה חכמה</bdbheb> <highlight>wise woman</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Sam 14:2\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(10,14,2)\">2Sam 14:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:16\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,16)\">2Sam 20:16</ref> generally, <ref ref=\"Jer 9:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,22)\">Jer 9:22</ref> intelligent animals <ref ref=\"Prov 30:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,24)\">Prov 30:24</ref> <bdbheb>בערמם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לכד ח</bdbheb> <highlight>taking the cunning in their craft</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 5:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,5,13)\">Job 5:13</ref> <bdbheb>חכם בעיני</bdbheb> <highlight>wise in one's own eyes</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,7)\">Prov 3:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,5)\">Prov 26:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,12)\">Prov 26:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 26:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,26,16)\">Prov 26:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 28:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,28,11)\">Prov 28:11</ref> <bdbheb>חכמי לב</bdbheb> <highlight>wise of mind</highlight> (in their own mind) <ref ref=\"Job 37:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,24)\">Job 37:24</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> plural class of <highlight>learned</highlight> and <highlight>shrewd</highlight> men, including astrologers, magicians and the like, of Egypt <ref ref=\"Gen 41:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,8)\">Gen 41:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 7:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,7,11)\">Exod 7:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; compare <ref ref=\"Isa 19:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,11)\">Isa 19:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 19:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,19,12)\">Isa 19:12</ref>); Babylon <ref ref=\"Isa 44:25\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,25)\">Isa 44:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 50:35\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(24,50,35)\">Jer 50:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 51:57\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"57\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"57\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,57)\">Jer 51:57</ref> Persia <ref ref=\"Esth 1:13\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,13)\">Esth 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 6:13\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(17,6,13)\">Esth 6:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>prudent</highlight>, towards king <ref ref=\"Prov 16:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,14)\">Prov 16:14</ref> in controversies <ref ref=\"Prov 11:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,29)\">Prov 11:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 29:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,8)\">Prov 29:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 29:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,9)\">Prov 29:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 29:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,11)\">Prov 29:11</ref> religious affairs <ref ref=\"Hos 13:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,13,13)\">Hos 13:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 14:10\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,10)\">Hos 14:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 4:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,22)\">Jer 4:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,8)\">Jer 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,9)\">Jer 8:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 4:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,6)\">Deut 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 32:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,6)\">Deut 32:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:43\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,43)\">Ps 107:43</ref> <bdbheb>אישׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 9:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,9,11)\">Jer 9:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>wise</highlight>, ethically and religiously,. in Wisdom Literature: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> as adjective, <bdbheb>חֲכַם לֵב</bdbheb> <highlight>wise of mind</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 10:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,8)\">Prov 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 16:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,21)\">Prov 16:21</ref> <bdbheb>לֵב חָכָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,5)\">Eccl 8:5</ref> of the son <ref ref=\"Prov 10:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,1)\">Prov 10:1</ref> = <ref ref=\"Prov 15:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,20)\">Prov 15:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:1\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,1)\">Prov 13:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 23:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,24)\">Prov 23:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:19\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,19)\">Eccl 2:19</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ילד ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Eccl 4:13\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(21,4,13)\">Eccl 4:13</ref> <highlight>wise boy</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>גבר ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:34\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,34)\">Job 34:34</ref> <highlight>wise man</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוכיח ח</bdbheb> <highlight>wise reprover</highlight> <ref ref=\"Prov 25:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,25,12)\">Prov 25:12</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> = substantive: (1) as a <highlight>wise learner</highlight> in school of wisdom, he fears God and departs from evil <ref ref=\"Prov 14:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,16)\">Prov 14:16</ref> is silent <ref ref=\"Prov 17:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,28)\">Prov 17:28</ref> hearkens to counsel <ref ref=\"Prov 12:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,15)\">Prov 12:15</ref> hears and increases in learning <ref ref=\"Prov 1:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,5)\">Prov 1:5</ref> his ear seeketh knowledge <ref ref=\"Prov 18:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,15)\">Prov 18:15</ref> he receives it <ref ref=\"Prov 21:11\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,11)\">Prov 21:11</ref> and stores it up <ref ref=\"Prov 10:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,10,14)\">Prov 10:14</ref> his ears hearken to the reproof which giveth life <ref ref=\"Prov 15:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,31)\">Prov 15:31</ref> and he becomes wiser through it <ref ref=\"Prov 9:8\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,8)\">Prov 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 9:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,9,9)\">Prov 9:9</ref>. (2) as a <highlight>wise teacher, a sage</highlight>, he does not answer with windy knowledge <ref ref=\"Job 15:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,2)\">Job 15:2</ref> he tells the experience of the past <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Job 15:48\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"48\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"48\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,48)\">Job 15:48</ref> has knowledge <ref ref=\"Job 34:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,2)\">Job 34:2</ref> teaches it <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,9)\">Eccl 12:9</ref> disperses it <ref ref=\"Prov 15:7\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,7)\">Prov 15:7</ref> his tongue is health <ref ref=\"Prov 12:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,18)\">Prov 12:18</ref> it utters knowledge aright <ref ref=\"Prov 15:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,2)\">Prov 15:2</ref> his mind instructs his mouth and adds learning to his lips <ref ref=\"Prov 16:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,23)\">Prov 16:23</ref> his words are gracious <ref ref=\"Eccl 10:12\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,12)\">Eccl 10:12</ref> it is good to hear his rebuke <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,5)\">Eccl 7:5</ref> his instruction is a fountain of life <ref ref=\"Prov 13:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,14)\">Prov 13:14</ref> one walking with him becomes wiser <ref ref=\"Prov 13:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,20)\">Prov 13:20</ref>. The <bdbheb>חכמים</bdbheb> recall the Greek <grk>σόφοι</grk>, having their schools, pupils (<bdbheb>בֵן</bdbheb>), discipline (<bdbheb>מוּסָר</bdbheb>), principles and collections of wisdom, <bdbheb>דברי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>חכמים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:6\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,6)\">Prov 1:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 22:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,22,17)\">Prov 22:17</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Prov 24:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,23)\">Prov 24:23</ref>), <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,17)\">Eccl 9:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 12:11\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(21,12,11)\">Eccl 12:11</ref> God himself is <bdbheb>חכם לבב</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 9:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,9,4)\">Job 9:4</ref>. (3) <highlight>the wise</highlight> are prosperous: true, in sceptical view of Ecclesiastes, they have no advantage over the fool <ref ref=\"Eccl 6:8\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(21,6,8)\">Eccl 6:8</ref> but die as the fool <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:16\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,16)\">Eccl 2:16</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Ps 49:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,49,11)\">Ps 49:11</ref> they will not be able to find the works of God <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:17\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,17)\">Eccl 8:17</ref> like others are in the hands of God <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,1)\">Eccl 9:1</ref> they do not secure bread <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:11\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,11)\">Eccl 9:11</ref> but elsewhere reverse is true: precious treasure is in his dwelling <ref ref=\"Prov 21:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,20)\">Prov 21:20</ref> his lips preserve him <ref ref=\"Prov 14:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,3)\">Prov 14:3</ref> they inherit glory <ref ref=\"Prov 3:35\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,35)\">Prov 3:35</ref> wealth is their crown <ref ref=\"Prov 14:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,24)\">Prov 14:24</ref> the wise man is strong <ref ref=\"Prov 24:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,24,5)\">Prov 24:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:19\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,19)\">Eccl 7:19</ref> his eyes are in his head <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:14\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,14)\">Eccl 2:14</ref> his mind is at his right hand <ref ref=\"Eccl 10:2\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(21,10,2)\">Eccl 10:2</ref> he interprets things <ref ref=\"Eccl 8:1\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(21,8,1)\">Eccl 8:1</ref> (4) the <highlight>wise</highlight> man is a blessing to others: he wins men <ref ref=\"Prov 11:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,30)\">Prov 11:30</ref> scales the city of the mighty <ref ref=\"Prov 21:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,21,22)\">Prov 21:22</ref> though poor he delivers the city <ref ref=\"Eccl 9:15\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(21,9,15)\">Eccl 9:15</ref> is a reproof to scorners <ref ref=\"Prov 15:12\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,12)\">Prov 15:12</ref> his mind is in the house of mourning <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:4\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,4)\">Eccl 7:4</ref> injustice makes him foolish <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:7\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,7)\">Eccl 7:7</ref> Job finds no wise men among his cruel friends <ref ref=\"Job 17:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,10)\">Job 17:10</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 4:6", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 3:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Deut 1:13", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 1, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Exod 28:3", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 28, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Isa 19:12", "bo